/- English proof (translation)
Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Assume the hypotheses and unpack their components. Establish an intermediate fact.

Establish an intermediate fact. Establish an intermediate fact. Reduce the claim to the hypotheses of an applicable result. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Establish an intermediate fact.

Reduce the claim to the hypotheses of an applicable result. Assume the hypotheses and unpack their components. A detailed English derivation is pending.
